CommitDate: Sun Sep 27 09:16:39 2026 -0500

    feat(ctrl-win): llm controller path head-to-head vs S0 jev baseline
    
    - scripts/run_base1_baseline.py: parameterize DECISION_MODE / RUN_ID_TAG /
      OUTPUT_PATH via env (BASE1_DECISION_MODE, BASE1_RUN_ID_TAG,
      BASE1_OUTPUT_PATH); report now stamps the mode actually seen in episode
      logs (llm runs no longer mis-stamped jev) and records llm_decisions_total
    - data/baselines/ctrlwin_llm_2026-09-27.json: llm arm artifact (5 episodes
      x 5 cycles, same boot state sha256 a74ca90b as BASE-1) + CTRL-WIN
      comparison section. Verdict: indeterminate - 0 map transitions in both
      arms at 5 cycles/episode; llm arm 12 real decisions / 0 escalations,
      jev arm 25 decisions / 7 escalations
    - tests/test_base1_baseline.py: mode-mismatch WARN now fires only on
      disagreeing logs (single-mode llm logs are trusted)
    
    Board task CTRL-WIN (gitreins), foreman tick ai-plays-poke-2026-09-27-13-45-59.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
